eedback to the  developer or to the tester to improve  and speed up the efficiency of  delivering code that gets delivered out  to the end user we went specifically  through the process that jenkins uses  and the jenkins pipeline and then  stepped through the architecture that  jenkins employs to be successful in  enabling you as a developer to build not  just one but maybe multiple platform  solutions at once and then finally we  step through a use case study around the  work that bosch is doing to be able to  significantly improve the efficiency of  the software that they are delivering  into the automotive industry really hope  that you've enjoyed this presentation if  you like it please hit subscribe and the  notification button below and you'll  always be kept up to date on new videos  that we are producing if you have any  ideas or comments please stick them  below and we'll have somebody from the  team answer your specific questions  hi there if you like this video  subscribe to the simply learn youtube  channel and click here to watch similar  videos to nerd up and get certified  click here
 

